
PLATFORM: Facebook post
- Community-friendly, conversational tone
- 180-300 words total — MINIMUM 180 WORDS
- Storytelling angle preferred over promotional
- Include one concrete example from the source or brand facts. Use a number, price, date or result only if it appears in the source content or the brand facts above. If there is none, make the point with a concrete detail in plain words instead. Never invent figures, prices, dates, customers or events.
- End with a question to drive comments
- No hashtags needed
